  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* Fix some deprecation warnings by @drdo in https://github.com/drdo/redu/pull/104\r\n* Update dependencies and fix warnings by @linkmauve in https://github.com/drdo/redu/pull/105\r\n* Add installation instructions for nix by @drdo in https://github.com/drdo/redu/pull/106\r\n* Update ratatui to 0.30 by @drdo in https://github.com/drdo/redu/pull/108\r\n* Change all github runner images to latest versions by @drdo in https://github.com/drdo/redu/pull/109\r\n* Explicit permissions for github workflows by @drdo in https://github.com/drdo/redu/pull/110\r\n* Small refactor in cache by @drdo in https://github.com/drdo/redu/pull/111\r\n* Bump to 0.2.15 and update deps by @drdo in https://github.com/drdo/redu/pull/112\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @linkmauve made their first contribution in https://github.com/drdo/redu/pull/105\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/drdo/redu/compare/v0.2.14...v0.2.15",
